  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a wide pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Stir in the minced garlic, cumin, paprika, oregano, salt, and pepper, cooking for another minute.",
    "Add the cubed tofu and stir to coat with the spices.",
    "Pour in the canned tomatoes and water, bring to a simmer and let cook for 20 minutes until the sauce thickens.",
    "Transfer the mixture to an oven‑proof dish and place under a preheated broiler for 3-5 minutes until the top turns slightly charred.",
    "Remove from the broiler, let rest for 2 minutes, then serve hot.",
    "Enjoy with a side of couscous or a fresh green salad if desired."
